<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa iyandikighwe na Yakobu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa iyandikighwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ino yandikighwa na munu yumwe iyakemighwe Yakobu. Yakoneka Yakobu yuno iye iyakalile mdodo wake Yesu, naye tsa chilongotsi mna likanisa lya mwanduso na mna libalatsa lya Yelusalemu (Gham 15:13). Mna ibaluwa ya Pauli kwa Wagalatiya (2:9), Mtumighwa Pauli kamkema Yakobu ka ingutso ye likanisa. Iwasomi wengi wotoghola ghendo ka ibaluwa ya Yakobu yandikighwa mna miyaka ya hamsini kulawa honeke Yesu. Kwaapfila yeye Yakobu tsa chilongotsi wa kanisa ililikalile Yelusalemu, apfo yakoneka kandika hayang'ali kokala kuko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakobu kawandikila makabila kumi na meli ighang'ali ghokala mna isi yose. Chayandike Yakobu chowalangulitsa Wakiristo wose lekeni yeye kwa kughandikila makabila kumi na meli yakoneka tsakabama ghendo kuwandikila Wakiristu wa Chiyahudi. Kwaapfila ibaluwa ino tsaibamighwa isomighwe ne iwanu wengi, ina mbuli nyingi. Yakobu tsakakomangitsa ukutoghola pfakusang'ana hamwe na ghamatendo. Kalonga ukutoghola kutsakoneka kubitila ghamatendo (2:17). Pfipfila kowaghoma iwanu waleke kulolesagha pfihanga pfa wanu, matajili au wahinghwa, na kotulongela tuwe wanu wa kwalangitsa kwa aghala ghatulonga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobu kowalamsa iwanu 1:1</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobu kowalongela iwanu wadudumile ahala hawoghanzika 1:2-27</para>
  <para style="io">Kuya Yakobu kolonga ukutoghola pfakubamighwa koneke kubitila ukutenda 2:1-26.</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobu kolonga mbuli tsine ngupfu pfatsili 3:1-12.</para>
  <para style="io">Pfipfila Yakobu kolonga ihekima ye Imulungu pfaili na ihekima ye isi pfaili. (3:13-4-10)</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobu kowakanya iwanu waleke kwitunya.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Nene Jakobu, imtumwa we Imulungu na we Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu. Nomwandikilani mwemwe ghamakabila kumi na meli yampwililike muisi. Nomlamsani.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola na ihekima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Ndughu tsangu, hamghetsighwa mna maghayo ghoghose ghala mdeng'elele ghendo, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />kwaapfila mwomanya hamghetsighwa mne ukutoghola kwenu, mwotendighwa mdudumile. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Mwalangitse ukududumila kwenu kuleke kutsigha, ili mkomale na mtimile na mleke kuhungukighwa ne ichinu chochose. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ka yumwe wenu kahungukighwa ihekima, alombe kwe Imulungu, Imulungu iyoweng'a iwanu wose kwa uluso bila ukukembela, naye katsakwing'ighwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Lekeni alombe kwa ukutoghola bila ukwalangula chochose. Kwaapfila imunu iyakwalangula keghala ne ghamawimbi ghe ibahali, ghotowighwa na kwasighwa ne libeho. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Imunu ka ayo aleke kwipfikitsa ka katsobokela ichinu chochose kulawa kwe Imtwatsa, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />imunu yakwalangula ipfinu pfibili mmoyo mwake, ng'akwima ghoya bae mna ghose ghayotenda.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunu mhingwa na imunu yane mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Ndughu iyali mhingwa kobamighwa adeng'elele ahala hakwinulighwa ne Imulungu. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Naye imunu iyane mali kobamighwa adeng'elele hayatsohulumsighwa ne Imulungu, kwaapfila katsohupa ka luwa lwa kwibagho. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Kwaapfila litsuwa lyolawa na kunyatsa imimeya, maluwa ghake gholaghala ne ukunogha kwake kwohupa. Apfo pfipfo kwe imunu yane mali, naye katsohupa mne sang'ano tsake.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukughetsighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Kabweda imunu yula iyodudumila hayoghetsighwa, kwaapfila hatsoluta mne ukughetsighwa katsobokela ghweko lya ughima, lila Imulungu lyawalongele katsoweng'a awala iwomnoghela. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Imunu ang'aghetsighwa, aleke kulonga, “Imulungu konighetsa.” Kwaapfila Imulungu ng'oghetsighwa bae kwa ghehile, wala ng'omghetsa imunu wowose atende ghehile. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Chila imunu koghetsighwa atende ghehile kwa tsitamaa tsake mwenyegho aku kokweghighwa na ukwonzighwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Kuya, itamaa ila ing'akomala, yakweleka nzambi, na nzambi nayo haikomala, yakweleka lifwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Ndughu tsangu, mleke kubughighwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Chila ghweko linoghile na ilikamilike lyolawa kuchanya, lyolawa kwa Aba we imimwanga ya kulanga, yeye ng'oghaluka bae na ng'olangusa chitango chochose cha uchigheugheu. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Kwa ukubama kwake mwenyegho katweleka kubitila usenga wa ukweli ili tuwe wa mwanduso mna pfilumbe wose yawalumbile.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuhulika na kutenda mbuli tse Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Ndughu tsangu wanoghelighwa, mkumbuke chinu chino, chila imunu asumke kutegheletsa, lekeni aleke kuwa chilabilabi, wala kusumka kwona maya, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />kwaapfila munu yane maya ng'odaha bae kutenda aghala ighamnoghelesa Imulungu. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Apfo mghaleke ghose ghehile na nzila tsenu tsose itsihile ghendo. Muibokele kwa uhole imbuli iihandighwe mghati mwenu iidaha kuwakombolani.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Mleke kwighutsukila kwa kuhulika hela imbuli yake, ila muitendele sang'ano. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Imunu wowose iyohulika mbuli lekeni ng'oitendela sang'ano bae, imunu ayo keghala ne imunu iyelola chihanga chake mne chilolelo, <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />na homalitsa kwilola, kakuka na baho kesemwa pfali. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Lekeni imunu iyolola ghoya laghitso ilitimile ilitenda iwanu weyanzale, na koghendelela kulikinda, ng'esemwa bae chayahulike, ila kochisang'ana, imunu ayo katsobweda mne chila chinu choyotenda.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Imunu wowose ang'ebona ka imunu wa dini na ng'olughoma bae lulimi lwake, imunu ayo keghutsukila imwenyegho, na dini yake yahela sang'ano. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Dini inoghile na ilihela totso hachinga ha Aba wetu Imulungu, iyo ino ano, kuwapfila iwachuwa ne pfitsuka mne maghayo ghawo, na kukala kutali na ghehile ighali muisi.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Ukwibaghula kokanyighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Ndughu tsangu, ka mwomtoghola Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu, Imtwatsa wa utunitso, mleke kuwabaghula iwanu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Tulonge katsa imunu mne mtingano wenu kapfala tsipete tsa nzahabu ne ghamaghwanda ghanoghile, na pfipfila katsa mhingwa kapfala ghamaghwanda ighalalile. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Ka mwombokela pfinoghile imunu yula iyapfalile ghamaghwanda ighanoghile na kumlongela, “Ukale hano hane chighoda chinoghile,” lekeni mwomlongela imunu yula mhingwa, “Ghweghwe wime hala,” au, “Kala hasi.” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Apfi awo si ubaghutsi bae uli mna mwemwe? Na ukulamla kwenu ng'akulawa bae mne mbutsi tsihile?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Ndughu tsangu wanoghelighwa, mtegheletse! Apfi Imulungu ng'awasaghule wahingwa we isi ino kuwa matajiri wa ukutoghola na kuhala undewa wawalongele katsoweng'a wala iwomnoghela? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Lekeni mwemwe mwowabetsa wahingwa. Apfi si iwanu wane mali bae iwombunzani mwemwe? Apfi si wawo bae iwowaghalani mwemwe mne libalatsa? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Apfi si wawo bae iwoliligha taghwa linoghile lye Imtwatsa, mwemwe yamli wanu wake?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Mtsotenda pfinoghile ka mwoghakinda Ghamalaghitso gha chindewa, ighali mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, “Mnoghele miyagho ka pfawinoghela ghumwenyegho.” <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Lekeni ka mwowabaghula iwanu, mwotenda nzambi na mwohighighwa ne Ghamalaghitso kwaapfila mwemwe ng'amkindile bae Ghamalaghitso. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Kwaapfila imunu iyokinda Ghamalaghitso ghose na kuleka kukinda laghitso limwe, imunu ayo kana totso lya kuleka kughakinda Ghamalaghitso ghose. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Kwaapfila yuyula iyalongile, “Uleke utsinzi,” pfipfila kalonga, “Uleke kukoma.” Ka ng'utenda bae utsinzi lekeni kwokoma, ghweghwe ng'ukinda bae Ghamalaghitso ghose. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Mlonge na mtende ka iwanu wala iwatsohighighwa kwa Ghamalaghitso ghala ighotenda iwanu weyanzale. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Kwaapfila Imulungu ng'atsomwonela libatsi bae imunu wowose iyalihela libatsi. Lekeni libatsi lyohuma ukuhigha.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Twolangusa tumtoghola Imulungu kwe ghamatendo ghetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Wandughu tsangu, apfi pfinogha imunu kulonga komtoghola Yesu aku ghamatendo ghake ng'agholangusa apfo? Apfi ukutoghola ako kodahatse kumkombola? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Tulonge, kwomwona ndughu yako au dada yako kahela ghamaghwanda na kahela ichijo. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Naghwe kwomlongela, “Ughende tseghamba, ukwote ghumoto na ukaje wighute,” lekeni ng'umwing'ile bae ichijo au ghamaghwanda. Apfi chutendile chomwapfila choni? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Pfipfila ukutoghola kuliyeka, ka ng'akulangusa ghamatendo, akwo kufwa ghendo.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Lekeni imunu kodaha kulonga, “Imunu yumwe kotoghola, na imunu yungi kana ghamatendo!” Na nene nitsomwidika, “Unilanguse lelo ukutoghola kwako kulihela ghamatendo. Nani nitsokulangusa ukutoghola kwangu kune ghamatendo.” <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Apfi kwotoghola ka hana Imulungu yumwe? Pfinogha! Na ipfinyamkela nawo pfipfila wotoghola pfipfo aku wodedema kwa kupfuka.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Kwambotsi! Apfi kwobama ulangusighwe ka ukutoghola kulihela ghamatendo kwahela isang'ano? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Pfii imbala wetu Abrahamu pfatendighwe kanogha hambele he Imulungu? Ambe kwa kubitila ghamatendo ghake, hamlapfile imwanaghe Isaka awe nambiko hanu ha kutambikila. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Mwakona! Ukutoghola kwake na ghamatendo ghake ghasang'ana hamwe. Ukutoghola kwake tsakutimila kubitila ghamatendo ghake. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Apfo Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghatimila, aghala ighalongile, “Abrahamu tsakamtoghola Imulungu, na kwa ukutoghola kwake, Abrahamu koneka kanogha hambele he Imulungu.” Apfo Abrahamu kakemighwa sale we Imulungu. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Mwakona, imunu kakoneka kanogha hambele he Imulungu kwa ghamatendo ghake na si kwa ukutoghola kuliyeka bae.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Pfipfila, Rahabu ayula pinga chiweghe katendighwa kanogha hambele he Imulungu kwa ghamatendo ghake, hala hayawabokele wapelembi na kuwalapfa kunze kwa nzila ingi.<verse eid="JAS 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ka apfila lukuli bila muhe lufa, pfipfo ukutoghola bila ghamatendo kufa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Kululongotsa lulimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Ndughu tsangu, mna mwemwe mleke kuwa na walangulitsi wengi, ka pfammanya twetwe walangulitsi tutsohighighwa ng'ani kubita iwanu wangi. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Twetwe twose tutotsagha. Ka imunu ng'ototsa bae mna ghayolonga, imunu ayo kakomala, kodaha kululongotsa lukuli lwake lwose. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Twetwe twakwoha imitsabi mne milomo ya falasi kuwatenda watuwinze, na twodaha kutsilongotsa ng'uli tsawo tsose kwokwose kwatubama. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Ebu uloleni mnumbwi, hata ka mkulu ng'ani na wosolighwa ne libeho likulu, wodaha kulongotsighwa ne mtela mdodo, nawo woghenda kwokwose mlongotsi kwoyobama ughende. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Pfipfo kwa lulimi, chilungo chidodo che lukuli, lekeni cheghodela pfinu pfikulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Lola isesi ya ghumoto pfaidaha kutenda muhulo ghulakale. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Pfipfila lulimi lweghala ne ghumoto, lwakwima hanu ha chila chinu chihile mghati mwe pfilungo pfetu, lwoluteda lukuli lwose lufinale na lwolakatsa ughima wose, nalwo lwakwaka ghumoto ighubwinighwe jehanamu. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Iwapfilumbe wose, iwanyama we kumuhulo, iwapfideghe, iwanyama iwotambala ne iwasomba wodaha kufughighwa, na ma wafughighwa ne iwanu. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Lekeni lulimi, haduhu imunu iyadahile kulufugha. Lulimi lwiha na ng'aludaha kulongosighwa, lumema sumu iighala lifwa. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Kwa lulimi twomtunya Imtwatsa na Aba wetu, kwa lulimi lulo twowalighita iwanu iwalumbighwe kwa kwighala ne Imulungu. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Mlomo wuwula wotunya na wolighita iwanu. Ndughu tsangu agha ghaleke kulawila! <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Apfi mbwibwi yodaha kulapfa ghamatsi ighanoghile na ghane munyu? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Ndughu tsangu, apfi mkuyu ghodaha kweleka ng'owo, au mkowo kweleka ng'uyu? Pfipfo mbwibwi ye ghamatsi ghe munyu ng'aidaha bae kulapfa ghamatsi ghanoghile.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihekima kulawa kulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Yuhi mghati mwenu yane ihekima na tsimbutsi? Yalanguse ghamatendo ghake ighanoghile kwa kukala pfinoghile, ghamatendo ighotendighwa kwa uhole na ihekima. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Lekeni ka imimoyo yenu imema chepfu chine usungu, ukwinoghela wenyegho mliheka na ukwibaghula, mleke kwighoda kwa kulonga ughutsu na kuulema ukweli. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Ihekima ayo ng'ailawa bae kulanga, ila yolawa bahano muisi, si ya Ghumuhe we Imulungu bae, ila ya chisetani. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Kwaapfila chila hane chepfu na hane iwanu iwenoghela wenyegho waliheka, aho hana hengele na chila chinu chihile. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ila ihekima iilawa kulanga tanu idegheta, yonoghela tindiwalo, ihola, yotegheletsa mbuli tse iwanu, imema libatsi na ina ghamatendo ghanoghile, yahela ubaghutsi wala ung'enye. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Ipfinu ipfimnoghelesa Imulungu pfolawa mne mbeghu itsihandighwa mne tindiwalo ne iwanu iwoghala tindiwalo.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Mwihulumse kwe Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Chihi ichiwatenda mwitowe na mwighobole mghati mwenu? Si tsitamaa tsenu tsihile bae itsitowagha mghati mwe ng'uli tsenu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Mwobama pfinu lekeni ng'ampfipata bae. Mwokoma na kwona chepfu, lekeni ng'amdaha bae kupata pfambama. Apfo mwetowa ne kwighobola. Mwahela pfinu kwaapfila ng'amumlomba Imulungu bae. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Hamlomba, ng'ambokela bae, kwaapfila mwolomba kwa tamaa tsihile, mwolomba pfinu apfo mpfitumile kwa tamaa tsenu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Mwemwe iwanu yang'amtogholighwa! Apfi ng'ammanya bae ka kuwa sale we iisi kumwihila Imulungu? Imunu wowose iyosaghula kuwa sale we pfinu pfe iisi, imunu ayo katsakuwa mwihile we Imulungu. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Apfi mwopfikitsa Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghalonga hela haghalongile, “Muhe iyamwikile Imulungu mghati mwetu kana chepfu ng'ani?” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Lekeni Imulungu katutendela uluso mkulu ghendo. Ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga, “Imulungu kowalema iwanu iweghoda, ila kowatendela uluso iwanu yang'aweghoda.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Apfo mumtegheletse Imulungu. Mumpinge Yehile, naye katsotsuma kulawa kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Msegheleleni Imulungu naye katsowasoghelelani. Mwopfughe ghamoko ghenu mwemwe yamne nzambi, muideghetese imimoyo yenu, mwemwe yamkwalangula ipfinu pfibilii mmoyo! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Mlile, mwiyayane na kwona usungu. Chiseko chenu chiwe chililo, na ukudeng'elela kwenu kuwe usungu. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Mwihulumse hambele he Imtwatsa, naye katsowenulani.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuwahigha wayagho koghomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Ndughu tsangu mleke kwilonga pfihile. Ka imunu komlonga pfihile ndughu yake na komuhigha, imunu ayo koghalonga pfihile ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu na koghahigha. Hauhigha ghamalaghitso, ng'ughakinda bae ghamalaghitso, ila kwoghahigha. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Imulungu yaliyeka iyolapfa ghamalaghitso na kuhigha, yeye yaliheka iyodaha kukombola na kukoma. Lelo ghweghwe uli nani mbaka umuhighe miyagho?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mleke kwighoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Lelo mtegheletse mwemwe yamlonga, “Leloli au ilupfi tutsoghenda mne ghumji ghumwe, tutsokala ghumwaka ghumwe aku twochuutsa pfinu na kupata sendi.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Mwemwe ng'ammanyile bae ughima wenu ilupfi utsakuwatse! Mwemwe mweghala na kungughu ililawila kwa chipindi chidodo kuya lyakuka. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Ila mwobamighwa kulonga, “Imtwatsa ang'abama tutsokala waghima, kuya tutsotenda chinu chino au chinu chila.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Lekeni sambi mwemwe mweghoda na ukwitunya, ukwighoda kwose ka kuno kwiha.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Apfo imunu iyomanya ghanoghile na ng'oghatenda bae, ayo kotenda nzambi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuwakanya iwanu wane tsimali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Mwemwe yamne tsimali, lelo mnihulikitse! Mlile na kuyayana kwaapfila ghamaghayo ghenu ghowatsilani. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Tsimali tsenu tsola, na ghamaghwanda ghenu ghajighwa ne iwamswa. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Tsahabu na pfetsa tsenu tsina ng'angagha. Ng'angagha ino itsolapfa ukalangama kuna mwemwe na itsotsija ng'uli tsenu ka ghumoto. Mwemwe mwilundikila tsimali mna ghamatsuwa ghano gha ukutsigha! <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Mlole! Ng'amuwalihe bae iwanu iwosang'ana mne imighunda yenu, nawo wosing'inika. Imtwatsa Yane ngupfu ng'ani kahulika chililo chawo. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Tsamkala muisi aku mwohondola, mwinoghetsa kwa pfinu pfinoghile. Mwitenda mnenehe kwa litsuwa lila lya ukuchinjighwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Mwemwe muwahigha na kuwakoma iwanu iwalihela totso yang'awomlemelani bae.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukududumila ne ukwilaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Ndughu tsangu mdudumile mbaka Imtwatsa yatse. Mloleni imunu iyolima pfobetetsa mghunda ghwake ghweleke ghamatsawo ghayoghabama sideke, na pfobetetsa imvula ya mwanduso mbaka ya kutsigha. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Pfipfila namwe mdudumile na mwime ghoya mna ukutoghola, kwaapfila Imtwatsa kahabehi kutsa.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Ndughu tsangu mleke kwinung'unikila, hela mtsohighighwa ne Imulungu. Yeye iyo mlamutsi iyali habehi kupfika! <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Ndughu tsangu, muwakumbuke manabii we Imulungu iwalongile kwa uwetso we Imtwatsa. Mwighale nawo ka pfawadudumile mne maghayo. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ka pfammanya, twowakema wabweda kwaapfila tsawadudumila. Muhulika Ayubu pfadudumile, mmwona Imtwatsa pfamtendele mbaka utsigho. Kwaapfila Imtwatsa kamema libatsi na uluso.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Kubita agho ghose, ndughu tsangu, mleke kwilaha kwa kulanga wala kwe isi, au kwa ichinu chochose. Hamlonga “Ona” iwe ona, na hamlonga “Bae,” iwe bae, ili mleke kuhighighwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulomba kwa ukutoghola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Pfii hana imunu iyoghaya mghati mwenu? Yamlombe Imulungu. Pfii hana munu iyodeng'elela? Na yembe wila wa kumtunya Imulungu. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Pfii hana imtamu mghati mwenu? Na yawakeme iwabala wa kanisa wamlombele na wambakatse ghamafuta kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Wang'alomba kwa ukutoghola mtamu katsohona, Imtwatsa katsomwinula. Ka katenda nzambi yoyose, Imulungu katsomleghusila nzambi ayo. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Apfo mwilongele nzambi tsenu mwemwe kwa mwemwe na mwilombele muhonetsighwe. Ukulomba kwa imunu iyomnoghelesa Imulungu kuna ngupfu ya kutenda mengi. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eliya tsakakala imunu ka twetwe. Kalomba kwa ghumoyo ghose imvula ileke kutowa, na imvula ng'aitowile bae muisi kwa miyaka midatu na miyetsi sita. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Kuya kalomba keli, imvula itowa na isi yeleka ghamatsawo.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Ndughu tsangu, imunu yumwe kuna mwemwe ang'agha kulawa mne nzila ya ukweli, na imunu yungi ang'amuyitsa, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />amanye pfino, imunu yamuyitsile imunu iyane nzambi kulawa mna nzila ihile, katsomkombola imunu ayo kulawa mne lifwa, na kutenda nzambi tsake nyingi tsileghusighwe ne Imulungu.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>